  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim of the Action is to enable and enhance entrepreneurship and innovation across Africa in a commercially viable way and to address a current gap in the Sub-Saharan market, by providing early stage venture capital paired with skills development.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
